  "$comment": "SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH — full API surface + frontend flow. Fahmin builds ALL UI against these shapes (never waits on Ayush). Ayush implements until every response matches (contract tests + sim must stay green). Shapes marked [EXISTS] already work; [TODO] are Ayush's build list. To change a shape: BOTH agree, edit here first, then code.",
